\":\"openclaw\",\"model\":\"delivery-mirror\",\"usage\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":0,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1771715358991}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/2ed1f065-3831-482e-8659-7cb81299cce6.jsonl.reset.2026-02-23T12-42-15.905Z:337:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"1c395c42\",\"parentId\":\"013f4b7a\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-21T23:09:19.455Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[{model} | thinking:{thinkingLevel}] 좋습니다. 가장 큰 로그 파일이 있습니다(452KB). 상세 로그를 확인해보겠습니다. 🔍\"}],\"api\":\"openai-responses\",\"provider\":\"openclaw\",\"model\":\"delivery-mirror\",\"usage\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":0,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1771715359455}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/2ed1f065-3831-482e-8659-7cb81299cce6.jsonl.reset.2026-02-23T12-42-15.905Z:338:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"4d176b26\",\"parentId\":\"1c395c42\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-21T23:09:19.941Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[{model} | thinking:{thinkingLevel}] ## 🔍 업데이트 실패 원인 발견!\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 🚨 핵심 문제\\n\\n**문제**: `@discordjs/opus` 모듈 설치 시 **빌드 도구 부족**\\n\\n```\\ngyp ERR! stack Error: not found: make\\ngyp ERR! command node node-gyp build --fallback-to-build\\ngyp ERR! System Linux 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔧 문제 분석\\n\\n### 1. **빌드 도구 부족**\\n\\n| 도구 | 상태 | 설명 |\\n|------|------|----------|\\n| `make` | ❌ 미설치 | C/C++ 코드 빌드에 필요 |\\n| `g++` | ❌ 미설치 | C++ 컴파일러 |\\n| `python3` | ❌ 미설치 | node-gyp 실행에 필요 |\\n\\n### 2. **WSL 환경 문제**\\n\\n- **OS**: Linux 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2\\n- **Node 버전**: v22.22.0\\n- **문제**: WSL은 기본 빌드 도구가 없음\\n\\n### 3. **@discordjs/opus 컴파일 실패**\\n\\n```\\nnode-pre-gyp ERR! build error \\nFailed to execute 'node node-gyp build --fallback-to-build'\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## ✅ 해결책\\n\\n### 방안 A: 빌드 도구 설치 (WSL 권장)\"}],\"api\":\"openai-responses\",\"provider\":\"openclaw\",\"model\":\"delivery-mirror\",\"usage\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":0,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1771715359941}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/2ed1f065-3831-482e-8659-7cb81299cce6.jsonl.reset.2026-02-23T12-42-15.905Z:339:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"90b3587a\",\"parentId\":\"4d176b26\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-21T23:09:20.434Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[{model} | thinking:{thinkingLevel}] sudo 패스워드가 필요합니다. **WSL 터미널에서 직접 설치하셔야 합니다.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔧 사용자 수동 설치 안내\\n\\n### **WSL 터미널**에서 다음 명령어 실행해주세요:\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. 빌드 도구 설치\\nsudo apt-get update\\nsudo apt-get install -y build-essential python3\\n\\n# 2. 설치 완료 확인\\nmake --version\\ng++ --version\\npython3 --version\\n\\n# 3. 다시 업데이트 시도\\nopenclaw update\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 설치 상태 예상\\n\\n| 단계 | 명령어 | 소요 시간 |\\n|------|----------|-----------|\\n| **1. apt 업데이트** | `sudo apt-get update` | 30초 ~ 2분 |\\n| **2. 빌드 도구 설치** | `sudo apt-get install -y build-essential python3` | 1~3분 |\\n| **3. 버전 확인** | `make --version`, `g++ --version` | 10초 |\\n| **4. openclaw 업데이트** | `openclaw update` | 30초 ~ 2분 |\\n\\n**총 예상 시간**: 3~7분\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 대안 옵션 (빌드 도구 설치가 복잡할 때)\\n\\n### 방안 B: Windows 환경에서 업데이트\\n\\n```powershell\\n# PowerShell에서 실행\\nnpm install -g openclaw@2026.2.21-2\\n```\\n\\n### 방안 C: Docker 사용 (WSL 빌드 도구 없이)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Docker 컨테이너에서 업데이트\\ndocker run --rm -it node:22 bash -c \\\"\\n  npm install -g openclaw@2026.2.21-2\\n\\\"\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 💡 권장\\n\\n**방안 A** (빌드 도구 설치)을 가장 권장합니다. 이것은 WSL에서 Node.js 패키지를 컴파일하는 데 필요한 기본 도구들입니다.\\n\\n**빌드 도구 설치 후 다시 업데이트 시도해주세요:**\\n```bash\\nsudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y build-essential python3 && openclaw update\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n**설치 완료 후 알려주시면 업데이트를 계속 진행하겠습니다.** 🦉\"}],\"api\":\"openai-responses\",\"provider\":\"openclaw\",\"model\":\"delivery-mirror\",\"usage\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":0,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1771715360434}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/2ed1f065-3831-482e-8659-7cb81299cce6.jsonl.reset.2026-02-23T12-42-15.905Z:356:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"51154a69\",\"parentId\":\"03a8fe4b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-21T23:41:18.597Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_b9f622cb8d034e6e9d03f6ec\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://mintlify.com/docs.json\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"OpenClaw\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Self-hosted gateway that connects WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more to AI coding agents. Run a single Gateway process on your own machine and message your AI assistant from anywhere.\\\",\\n  \\\"theme\\\": \\\"mint\\\",\\n  \\\"icons\\\": {\\n    \\\"library\\\": \\\"lucide\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"logo\\\": {\\n    \\\"light\\\": \\\"/assets/pixel-lobster.svg\\\",\\n    \\\"dark\\\": \\\"/assets/pixel-lobster.svg\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"fonts\\\": {\\n    \\\"body\\\": {\\n      \\\"family\\\": \\\"Fragment Mono\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"heading\\\": {\\n      \\\"family\\\": \\\"DM Sans\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"favicon\\\": \\\"/assets/pixel-lobster.svg\\\",\\n  \\\"colors\\\": {\\n    \\\"primary\\\": \\\"#FF5A36\\\",\\n    \\\"dark\\\": \\\"#FF5A36\\\",\\n    \\\"light\\\": \\\"#FF8A6B\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"styling\\\": {\\n    \\\"codeblocks\\\": {\\n      \\\"theme\\\": {\\n        \\\"dark\\\": \\\"min-dark\\\",\\n        \\\"light\\\": \\\"min-light\\\"\\n      }\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"navbar\\\": {\\n    \\\"links\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"GitHub\\\",\\n        \\\"href\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\\\",\\n        \\\"icon\\\": \\\"github\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"Releases\\\",\\n        \\\"href\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/releases\\\",\\n        \\\"icon\\\": \\\"package\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"redirects\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/messages\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/concepts/messages\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/context\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/concepts/context\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/compaction\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/concepts/compaction\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/cron\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/cron-jobs\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/minimax\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/minimax\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/xiaomi\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/xiaomi\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/openai\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/openai\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/openai/\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/openai\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/anthropic\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/anthropic\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/anthropic/\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/anthropic\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/moonshot\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/moonshot\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/openrouter\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/openrouter\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/opencode\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/providers/opencode\\\"\\n\\n[1759 more lines in file. Use offset=101 to continue.]\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp