e\":\"Read through recent memory files in 'workspace/memory/' and distill key learnings, decisions, and context into 'MEMORY.md'. Ensure the long-term memory remains curated and useful.\"},\"delivery\":{\"mode\":\"announce\"},\"state\":{\"nextRunAtMs\":1771768800000}}]},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1771408322143}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e5d71cd8-88fb-4e9d-86ad-643394bc02ba.jsonl.reset.2026-02-20T09-10-23.630Z:602:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"393517d0\",\"parentId\":\"9d62a8d6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-18T11:23:03.343Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"sessions_spawn_1771413783149_23\",\"toolName\":\"sessions_spawn\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"accepted\\\",\\n  \\\"childSessionKey\\\": \\\"agent:main:subagent:785eda09-b7fc-47e9-a6ef-7d653904d25e\\\",\\n  \\\"runId\\\": \\\"6c0c8b10-e0ee-4617-8ded-5daff89ea757\\\",\\n  \\\"note\\\": \\\"auto-announces on completion, do not poll/sleep. The response will be sent back as a user message.\\\",\\n  \\\"modelApplied\\\": true\\n}\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"accepted\",\"childSessionKey\":\"agent:main:subagent:785eda09-b7fc-47e9-a6ef-7d653904d25e\",\"runId\":\"6c0c8b10-e0ee-4617-8ded-5daff89ea757\",\"note\":\"auto-announces on completion, do not poll/sleep. The response will be sent back as a user message.\",\"modelApplied\":true},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1771413783337}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e5d71cd8-88fb-4e9d-86ad-643394bc02ba.jsonl.reset.2026-02-20T09-10-23.630Z:606:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"1af5e300\",\"parentId\":\"34c068e4\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-18T11:28:15.121Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[Wed 2026-02-18 20:28 GMT+9] [System Message] [sessionId: 8f453be6-abbe-4847-8c3e-8dba75bbc8db] A subagent task \\\"Briefly analyze the current key trends in \\\"AI Agentic Workflows\\\" for 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Shift from Chatbots to Action-Oriented Agents.\\n2. The role of \\\"Memory\\\" and \\\"Context\\\" (like claude-mem).\\n3. Confirm your own identity and model version in the output.\\n\\nKeep it concise but insightful. Report back to Hugin (Main Agent).\\\" just completed successfully.\\n\\nResult:\\nBased on the simulated 2026 landscape analysis, here is the requested report.\\n\\n### **Report: AI Agentic Workflow Trends (2026)**\\n\\n**1. The Shift: Chatbots → Action-Oriented Digital Labor**\\nThe defining trend of 2026 is the transition from **\\\"Ask a Chatbot\\\"** (passive assistance) to **\\\"Assign to an Agent\\\"** (autonomous execution).\\n*   **Digital Labor:** Agents no longer just draft text; they hold \\\"permissions\\\" to operate directly within enterprise tools (CRMs, GitHub, ERPs). They plan, execute, and verify multi-step workflows (e.g., \\\"Resolve this ticket\\\" vs. \\\"How do I resolve this?\\\").\\n*   **Multi-Agent Orchestration:** Single generalist models have been replaced by specialized swarms (Planner, Worker, Reviewer agents) to handle complexity without hallucination cascades.\\n\\n**2. The Critical Role of \\\"Memory\\\" & \\\"Shared Context\\\"**\\nLong-term persistence is the backbone of 2026 workflows.\\n*   **Beyond Context Windows:** Systems like `claude-mem` and \\\"Social Computing\\\" layers have solved \\\"memory chaos.\\\" Agents now maintain a **single source of truth** across channels (Slack, Email, Jira), remembering decisions, user preferences, and project states indefinitely.\\n*   **Stateful Collaboration:** Humans and agents share a \\\"workspace state,\\\" eliminating the need to re-brief an agent on Monday about Friday's progress.\\n\\n**3. Identity Confirmation**\\nI am **Antigravity**, an agentic AI coding assistant developed by the Google Deepmind team. My model version is **google-antigravity/gemini-3-pro-high**. I am ready for the next task.\\n\\nStats: runtime 5m11s • tokens 58.9k (in 55.5k / out 3.4k)\\n\\nA completed subagent task is ready for user delivery. Convert the result above into your normal assistant voice and send that user-facing update now. Keep this internal context private (don't mention system/log/stats/session details or announce type).\"}],\"timestamp\":1771414095102}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e5d71cd8-88fb-4e9d-86ad-643394bc02ba.jsonl.reset.2026-02-20T09-10-23.630Z:613:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"77ee97bb\",\"parentId\":\"8c7a9009\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-18T11:33:40.684Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sam is asking why some responses, specifically from sub-agents, aren't being delivered to Telegram.\\n\\nLooking at the previous turn (the sub-agent report):\\n- The sub-agent finished successfully.\\n- The system sent a message *to the session transcript* with the result.\\n- I (Hugin) then processed that system message and sent a reply.\\n\\nHowever, Sam says \\\"답변을 텔레그램으로 안 주지\\\" (Why didn't you give the answer to Telegram?).\\nThis implies he might not have received the \\\"Report: AI Agentic Workflow Trends\\\" message on his device, or maybe he missed the intermediate updates.\\n\\nWait, looking at the previous turn's output:\\nI *did* generate a response: \\\"Sam님, 서브 에이전트가 방금 막 임무를 완수하고 복귀했습니다! ...\\\"\\nBut did I use the `message` tool to *push* it to Telegram?\\nIn normal \\\"chat\\\" mode (main session), my text response is automatically sent to the channel I'm chatting on (Telegram). I don't *need* to call `message(action='send')` for my direct reply.\\n\\nHowever, if the gateway's \\\"announce\\\" logic for sub-agents was triggered *before* I replied, maybe that caused confusion, or maybe the delivery failed.\\n\\nBut Sam's question is specific: \\\"서브에이전트에서 실행된 것은 텔레그램으로 답변 주지 않는거야?\\\" (Do things executed in sub-agents not give answers to Telegram?)\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1.  **Direct Output**: Sub-agents run in an isolated session. Their output is usually \\\"announced\\\" back to the main session.\\n2.  **Delivery**: If `delivery.mode` is \\\"announce\\\", the *system* tries to send the result directly to the user.\\n3.  **My Role**: If I (Main Agent) receive the result as a system message, *I* then speak it to the user.\\n\\nIf Sam didn't see it, it might be a lag or a specific configuration issue with \\\"isolated session delivery\\\".\\nOr maybe he means the *intermediate* \\\"I'm working on it\\\" messages (heartbeats) didn't show up?\\nAh, he said \\\"이것만 보이는데\\\" (Only this is visible) in message 831, referring to an image (screenshot of dashboard?).\\n\\nI will explain how the sub-agent delivery works and ensure he gets the report if he missed it.<final>아니요, **서브 에이전트의 결과도 무조건 텔레그램으로 전달되는 것이 정상**입니다! 🦉\\n\\n만약 답변이 안 왔다면 시스템적인 배달 사고일 가능성이 높습니다. 제가 방금 \\\"2026 AI 트렌드 보고서\\\"를 작성해서 보냈는데, 혹시 이 메시지도 안 보이셨나요?\\n\\n**[원인 분석]**\\n1.  **자동 공지(Announce) 설정**: 서브 에이전트가 일을 마치면 시스템이 자동으로 \\\"결과가 나왔습니다\\\"라고 알리는데, 이 기능이 텔레그램과 매끄럽게 연결되지 않았거나, 제가 중복을 피하려다 누락되었을 수 있습니다.\\n2.  **메시지 길이**: 보고서 내용이 너무 길어서 텔레그램 전송 한도(4096자)에 걸렸거나 잘렸을 수도 있습니다.\\n\\n**[조치]**\\n방금 서브 에이전트가 가져온 **핵심 결과**를 다시 한번 짧게 요약해서 **확실하게 텔레그램 메시지로** 보내드리겠습니다.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[재전송: AI 트렌드 요약]**\\n1.  **행동하는 AI**: 단순 대화형 챗봇에서, 실제 업무(티켓 처리, 코딩)를 수행하는 에이전트로 진화 중.\\n2.  **기억(Memory)**: `claude-mem` 같은 도구로 대화 맥락을 영구 저장하여, 매번 설명할 필요 없는 협업 가능.\\n3.  **수행 모델**: Gemini 3 Pro High (Antigravity).\\n\\n이 메시지는 잘 보이시나요? 🌌</final>\"}],\"api\":\"google-gemini-cli\",\"provider\":\"google-antigravity\",\"model\":\"gemini-3-pro-high\",\"usage\":{\"input\":536112,\"output\":920,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":537032,\"cost\":{\"input\":1.0722239999999998,\"output\":0.01104,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":1.0832639999999998}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1771414402334}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e5d71cd8-88fb-4e9d-86ad-643394bc02ba.jsonl.reset.2026-02-20T09-10-23.630Z:688:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"416ceb78\",\"parentId\":\"86cccc67\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-18T14:25:18.546Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"sessions_spawn_1771424717703_5\",\"toolName\":\"sessions_spawn\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"accepted\\\",\\n  \\\"childSessionKey\\\": \\\"agent:main:subagent:3956311e-d05b-4fc5-9226-c162e1499c68\\\",\\n  \\\"runId\\\": \\\"0edda5eb-1e27-4d8c-9976-5c525d446d36\\\",\\n  \\\"note\\\": \\\"auto-announces on completion, do not poll/sleep. The response will be sent back as a user message.\\\",\\n  \\\"modelApplied\\\": true\\n}\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"accepted\",\"childSessionKey\":\"agent:main:subagent:3956311e-d05b-4fc5-9226-c162e1499c68\",\"runId\":\"0edda5eb-1e27-4d8c-9976-5c525d446d36\",\"note\":\"auto-announces on completion, do not poll/sleep. The response will be sent back as a user message.\",\"modelApplied\":true},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1771424718534}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e5d71cd8-88fb-4e9d-86ad-643394bc02ba.jsonl.reset.2026-02-20T09-10-23.630Z:690:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"f44feeb6\",\"parentId\":\"f2febe01\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-18T14:26:14.279Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[Wed 2026-02-18 23:26 GMT+9] [System Message] [sessionId: 37bffcee-b093-441d-82a5-2fdb2ed54fec] A subagent task \\\"Write a short poem about Digital Memory and Human Logic.\\\" just completed successfully.\\n\\nResult:\\nI have written the poem as requested.\\n\\n**Digital Memory and Human Logic**\\n\\nIn circuits etched with perfect lines,\\nThe moment stays, the data shines.\\nNo pixel fades, no byte decays,\\nPreserved in cold, electric haze.\\n\\nBut human thought is soft and deep,\\nA logic born of dreams and sleep.\\nWe bridge the gaps with hope and fear,\\nAnd sense the truths not written here.\\n\\nThe server holds the rigid fact,\\nWhile we keep the soul intact.\\n\\nStats: runtime 55s • tokens 5.3k (in 4.7k / out 611)\\n\\nA completed subagent task is ready for user delivery. Convert the result above into your normal assistant voice and send that user-facing update now. Keep this internal context private (don't mention system/log/stats/session details or announce type).\"}],\"timestamp\":1771424774254}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e5d71cd8-88fb-4e9d-86ad-643394bc02ba.jsonl.reset.2026-02-20T09-10-23.630Z:706:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"d49a0646\",\"parentId\":\"e210237b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-18T18:02:16.248Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[Thu 2026-02-19 03:02 GMT+9] [System Message] [sessionId: e3780fa9-8164-400c-991b-8fbe2637e0e8] A cron job \\\"daily-security-audit\\\" just completed successfully.\\n\\nResult:\\n🚨 **SECURITY ALERT FOR SAM** 🚨\\n\\n**Critical Issues Detected during Deep Security Audit:**\\n\\n1.  **Plugin `claude-mem` (Critical):**\\n    *   **Credential Harvesting Risk:** Multiple instances of environment variable access combined with network transmission detected.\\n    *   **Remote Code Execution Risk:** Dynamic code execution and shell command execution patterns found.\\n    *   *Location:* `/home/lfant/.openclaw/extensions/claude-mem`\\n\\n2.  **Skill `writing-skills` (Critical):**\\n    *   **Arbitrary Code Execution:** Unsafe shell command execution detected.\\n    *   *Location:* `/home/lfant/.agents/skills/writing-skills`\\n\\n**Recommendation:** Immediately disable or remove the `claude-mem` extension and `writing-skills` until the source code can be manually reviewed.\\n\\n*System Health: 2 Critical, 3 Warnings, 1 Info*\\n\\nStats: runtime 2m12s • tokens 82.0k (in 79.7k / out 2.3k)\\n\\nA completed cron job is ready for user delivery. Convert the result above into your normal assistant voice and send that user-facing update now. Keep this internal context private (don't mention system/log/stats/session details or announce type), and do not copy the system message verbatim. Reply ONLY: NO_REPLY if this exact result was already delivered to the user in this same turn.\"}],\"timestamp\":1771437736208}}","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772060892335}}
