{"type":"message","id":"664888e7","parentId":"c8266168","timestamp":"2026-02-25T23:08:43.156Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_I75SYQGmQaoyrRORE0MmqTkC|fc_0e42ccf8bd3f538101699f80f9fe508191a6ce00b18948c640","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — Less middlemen, more messages.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron add|create [options]\n\nAdd a cron job\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>           Agent id for this job\n  --announce             Announce summary to a chat (subagent-style) (default:\n                         false)\n  --at <when>            Run once at time (ISO) or +duration (e.g. 20m)\n  --best-effort-deliver  Do not fail the job if delivery fails (default: false)\n  --channel <channel>    Delivery channel (last) (default: \"last\")\n  --cron <expr>          Cron expression (5-field or 6-field with seconds)\n  --delete-after-run     Delete one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --deliver              Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a summary to a\n                         chat.\n  --description <text>   Optional description\n  --disabled             Create job disabled (default: false)\n  --every <duration>     Run every duration (e.g. 10m, 1h)\n  --exact                Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0) (default:\n                         false)\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --keep-after-run       Keep one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --message <text>       Agent message payload\n  --model <model>        Model override for agent jobs (provider/model or alias)\n  --name <name>          Job name\n  --no-deliver           Disable announce delivery and skip main-session summary\n  --session <target>     Session target (main|isolated)\n  --stagger <duration>   Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>  System event payload (main session)\n  --thinking <level>     Thinking level for agent jobs\n                         (off|minimal|low|medium|high)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>  Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>            Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram chatId, or\n                         Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>        Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>            Timezone for cron expressions (IANA) (default: \"\")\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)\n  --wake <mode>          Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat) (default: \"now\")"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3382,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — Less middlemen, more messages.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron add|create [options]\n\nAdd a cron job\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>           Agent id for this job\n  --announce             Announce summary to a chat (subagent-style) (default:\n                         false)\n  --at <when>            Run once at time (ISO) or +duration (e.g. 20m)\n  --best-effort-deliver  Do not fail the job if delivery fails (default: false)\n  --channel <channel>    Delivery channel (last) (default: \"last\")\n  --cron <expr>          Cron expression (5-field or 6-field with seconds)\n  --delete-after-run     Delete one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --deliver              Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a summary to a\n                         chat.\n  --description <text>   Optional description\n  --disabled             Create job disabled (default: false)\n  --every <duration>     Run every duration (e.g. 10m, 1h)\n  --exact                Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0) (default:\n                         false)\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --keep-after-run       Keep one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --message <text>       Agent message payload\n  --model <model>        Model override for agent jobs (provider/model or alias)\n  --name <name>          Job name\n  --no-deliver           Disable announce delivery and skip main-session summary\n  --session <target>     Session target (main|isolated)\n  --stagger <duration>   Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>  System event payload (main session)\n  --thinking <level>     Thinking level for agent jobs\n                         (off|minimal|low|medium|high)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>  Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>            Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram chatId, or\n                         Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>        Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>            Timezone for cron expressions (IANA) (default: \"\")\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)\n  --wake <mode>          Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat) (default: \"now\")","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772060923153}}
{"type":"message","id":"992db599","parentId":"664888e7","timestamp":"2026-02-25T23:08:44.023Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_iN3LByxy0numBIgx686MKUFu|fc_0e42ccf8bd3f538101699f80f9fe5c8191ad059f0ea1f2a0b7","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — I'm not saying your workflow is chaotic... I'm just bringing a linter and a helmet.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron edit [options] <id>\n\nEdit a cron job (patch fields)\n\nArguments:\n  id                        Job id\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>              Set agent id\n  --announce                Announce summary to a chat (subagent-style)\n  --at <when>               Set one-shot time (ISO) or duration like 20m\n  --best-effort-deliver     Do not fail job if delivery fails\n  --channel <channel>       Delivery channel (last)\n  --clear-agent             Unset agent and use default (default: false)\n  --cron <expr>             Set cron expression\n  --delete-after-run        Delete one-shot job after it succeeds (default:\n                            false)\n  --deliver                 Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a summary to\n                            a chat.\n  --description <text>      Set description\n  --disable                 Disable job (default: false)\n  --enable                  Enable job (default: false)\n  --every <duration>        Set interval duration like 10m\n  --exact                   Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0)\n  --expect-final            Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help                Display help for command\n  --keep-after-run          Keep one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --message <text>          Set agentTurn payload message\n  --model <model>           Model override for agent jobs\n  --name <name>             Set name\n  --no-best-effort-deliver  Fail job when delivery fails\n  --no-deliver              Disable announce delivery\n  --session <target>        Session target (main|isolated)\n  --stagger <duration>      Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>     Set systemEvent payload\n  --thinking <level>        Thinking level for agent jobs\n  --timeout <ms>            Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>     Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>               Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram chatId, or\n                            Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>           Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>               Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)\n  --url <url>               Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to\n                            gateway.remote.url when configured)\n  --wake <mode>             Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":858,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.24 (df9a474) — I'm not saying your workflow is chaotic... I'm just bringing a linter and a helmet.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron edit [options] <id>\n\nEdit a cron job (patch fields)\n\nArguments:\n  id                        Job id\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>              Set agent id\n  --announce                Announce summary to a chat (subagent-style)\n  --at <when>               Set one-shot time (ISO) or duration like 20m\n  --best-effort-deliver     Do not fail job if delivery fails\n  --channel <channel>       Delivery channel (last)\n  --clear-agent             Unset agent and use default (default: false)\n  --cron <expr>             Set cron expression\n  --delete-after-run        Delete one-shot job after it succeeds (default:\n                            false)\n  --deliver                 Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a summary to\n                            a chat.\n  --description <text>      Set description\n  --disable                 Disable job (default: false)\n  --enable                  Enable job (default: false)\n  --every <duration>        Set interval duration like 10m\n  --exact                   Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0)\n  --expect-final            Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help                Display help for command\n  --keep-after-run          Keep one-shot job after it succeeds (default: false)\n  --message <text>          Set agentTurn payload message\n  --model <model>           Model override for agent jobs\n  --name <name>             Set name\n  --no-best-effort-deliver  Fail job when delivery fails\n  --no-deliver              Disable announce delivery\n  --session <target>        Session target (main|isolated)\n  --stagger <duration>      Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>     Set systemEvent payload\n  --thinking <level>        Thinking level for agent jobs\n  --timeout <ms>            Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>     Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>               Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram chatId, or\n                            Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>           Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>               Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)\n  --url <url>               Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to\n                            gateway.remote.url when configured)\n  --wake <mode>             Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat)","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772060924016}}
