{"type":"message","id":"aaeb91fe","parentId":"47874936","timestamp":"2026-02-25T23:09:29.516Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_LOn0As3hvyccZsIZ8csS5DIN|fc_0e42ccf8bd3f538101699f812940148191822b299080ea3473","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f.jsonl ===\n{\"ts\":1771768914902,\"jobId\":\"07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"cron announce delivery failed\",\"summary\":\"## Memory Maintenance Summary\\n\\nI've distilled the key learnings from the past 7 days into MEMORY.md. Here's what was captured:\\n\\n### Core Architecture\\n- **Model routing policy established:** GLM-4.7 as fast router for trivial tasks, Codex GPT-5.3-Codex for complex reasoning\\n- **Aggressive spawn-first mode:** Subagents spawned immediately for 2+ step tasks, code changes, debugging\\n- This is a critical operational decision - always use `sessions_spawn` with Codex for non-trivial work\\n\\n### Security Insights\\n- **Tavily-search false positive:** Legitimate API usage flagged as credential harvesting - should add to audit whitelist\\n- **Acceptable warnings identified:** Gateway reverse proxy headers and extension plugin tool policy are expected for loopback-only binding\\n- **Security pattern:** `openclaw.json` contains secrets - backup repository must remain private\\n\\n### Automation Architecture\\n- **6 cron jobs configured:** GitHub backup (04:00), update check (06:00), security audit (06:37), memory maintenance (23:00), morning briefing (07:00), Notion briefing (08:00)\\n- **Scheduling logic:** Updates before business hours, 24-hour lookback windows for consistency\\n- **Delivery optimization:** Isolated agent turns, no redundant announce modes to prevent duplicates\\n\\n### Troubleshooting Patterns\\n- **WSL2 + Node 22 + IPv6 issue:** Future API timeouts should check IPv6 configuration first\\n- **Update workflow:** Background process with post-update verification, gateway restart required for model config changes\\n\\n### Memory Architecture\\n- **Three-tier system:** SESSION-STATE.md (ephemeral), memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md (raw logs), MEMORY.md (curated wisdom)\\n- **WAL protocol:** Captures human input before responding to prevent context loss\\n- **Security warning:** Persistent memory + external communication = extreme attack surface\\n\\n### Identity Evolution\\n- **Antigravity → Hugin:** Transitioned from 🌌 to 🦉 persona\\n- **Operating principles:** Resourcefulness before asking, insight over informatio…\",\"sessionId\":\"e31b4255-e5ba-4cdd-9ac3-a52f2da843e7\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f:run:e31b4255-e5ba-4cdd-9ac3-a52f2da843e7\",\"runAtMs\":1771768802618,\"durationMs\":112278,\"nextRunAtMs\":1772373600000,\"model\":\"glm-4.7\",\"provider\":\"zai\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":11359,\"output_tokens\":4281,\"total_tokens\":19730}}\n{\"ts\":1771882805108,\"jobId\":\"07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"summary\":\"## Memory Maintenance Complete ✅\\n\\nSuccessfully distilled key learnings, decisions, and context from the past 8 days into MEMORY.md.\\n\\n### Summary of Updates:\\n\\n**Key Sections Added/Updated:**\\n1. **User Profile** - Sam's communication preferences (frustrated with context memory issues)\\n2. **System Architecture** - OpenClaw v2026.2.21-2, model routing (GLM primary, Codex fallback), cron jobs status\\n3. **Automation & Integrations** - GitHub backup, Notion API, Tavily search configurations\\n4. **Critical Issues** - Memory system problems (context contamination), Telegram delivery failures, CLI PATH issues\\n5. **Identity & Persona** - Hugin (🦉) from Antigravity (🌌)\\n6. **Security Context** - CVE-2025-24813 overdue, false positives catalogued\\n7. **Project History** - Design work, model testing, subagent pairing issues\\n8. **Technical Notes** - WSL2 Node 22+ IPv6 troubleshooting, WAL system (with warning not to over-explain)\\n\\n### Important Discoveries:\\n- **Memory System Problem:** Agent repeatedly responding about WAL when user didn't ask - indicates context tracking failure\\n- **Cron Tasks Working:** All scheduled jobs execute successfully, only Telegram \\\"announce\\\" delivery fails\\n- **CLI Path Issue:** Daily security audit's deep scan fails because `openclaw` not in PATH (npx installation)\\n- **Model Routing:** Aggressive mode confirmed as user preference - spawn Codex for almost all non-trivial work\\n\\n### Status:\\n- **MEMORY.md:** 8,820 bytes, fully curated\\n- **Entries Processed:** 7 daily memory files (Feb 16-23)\\n- **Key Insights Captured:** System architecture, automation configs, security issues, user preferences, technical workarounds\\n\\nThe long-term memory is now current and curated for future sessions.\",\"delivered\":true,\"deliveryStatus\":\"delivered\",\"sessionId\":\"1372c5a6-8669-4f55-abab-42c8baef5b6d\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f:run:1372c5a6-8669-4f55-abab-42c8baef5b6d\",\"runAtMs\":1771882746873,\"durationMs\":58234,\"nextRunAtMs\":1772373600000,\"model\":\"glm-4.7\",\"provider\":\"zai\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":12927,\"output_tokens\":4269,\"total_tokens\":25140}}\n=== 52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93.jsonl ===\n{\"ts\":1771441224653,\"jobId\":\"52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"summary\":\"Backup done\",\"sessionId\":\"96817ce3-859a-4a1b-a853-06d53f39da46\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93:run:96817ce3-859a-4a1b-a853-06d53f39da46\",\"runAtMs\":1771441202934,\"durationMs\":21714,\"nextRunAtMs\":1771527600000,\"model\":\"gemini-3-pro-high\",\"provider\":\"google-antigravity\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":14234,\"output_tokens\":167,\"total_tokens\":8640}}\n{\"ts\":1771535451035,\"jobId\":\"52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"summary\":\"Cloud Co