ns & Upgrades\\n*   **Database Optimization:** Srikanth N proposed downgrading two Azure SQL DBs (`eventstorekr-nprdsqldb`, `o9kr-nprdsqldb`) as they are over-provisioned. Approval is needed to proceed.\\n*   **Netskope Client Upgrade (v132):** Jitendra Thawait is planning the upgrade for APAC. Huan (Vietnam) has approved UAT but asked for target dates/validation requirements.\\n*   **Oracle Licensing:** Mayank Chauhan shared a \\\"Licensing Scripts\\\" folder and an \\\"Oracle Applications & Middleware Baseline\\\" document for you to edit.\\n\\n### ℹ️ FYI & Updates\\n*   **Security Confirmations:**\\n    *   **Rodrigo Haro** confirmed no malicious npm/PyPI packages (Lazarus campaign) were found in the environment.\\n    *   **Beomsik Shin** confirmed he is the sole Security SPOC for Korea.\\n*   **Holiday Notices:** Several colleagues (Coco Zhang, Elaine Tan) are on leave for holidays/Lunar New Year follow…\",\"sessionId\":\"ab440203-fead-4973-a6ac-687bba4243e8\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89:run:ab440203-fead-4973-a6ac-687bba4243e8\",\"runAtMs\":1771455602938,\"durationMs\":17769,\"nextRunAtMs\":1771542000000,\"model\":\"gemini-3-pro-high\",\"provider\":\"google-antigravity\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":16670,\"output_tokens\":953,\"total_tokens\":11056}}\n{\"ts\":1771457149710,\"jobId\":\"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"summary\":\"Here is your **Notion Daily Briefing** for today (Feb 18th 07:00 – Feb 19th 07:00).\\n\\nThere’s quite a bit of activity, especially around network security scans and some urgent tasks due today. I’ve grouped them by topic for you:\\n\\n### 🚨 Urgent & Action Required (Due Today/Soon)\\n*   **Vulnerability Management (Korea):** You have 2 tasks in Microsoft Planner due **today (Feb 18)**: `ONEKORCRMAP002A` and `ONEKORSACAP01` (both related to CVE-2025-24813).\\n*   **Network Scans (Major Issue):** There is an ongoing thread about **Network Authen